1
00:00:15,625 --> 00:00:25,205
Oisin: The falls went quiet in the night. I walked the bounds at first light. Eight still moving. One gone over to glass.

2
00:00:26,438 --> 00:00:35,318
Niamh: Eight is not nine, and you will wear a hole in the snow pacing about it. Come stand by the well where I can see you fret.

3
00:00:36,562 --> 00:00:45,303
Oisin: You told me to walk every morning. And that on the morning I forgot the number, you would remember it for me. That was the bargain.

4
00:00:49,250 --> 00:01:00,170
Niamh: Then hear me keep it. Nine. Ice is still water, love. It is only water that has decided to rest a while.

5
00:01:01,375 --> 00:01:06,005
Oisin: Nine, then. Nine... and one of them resting.
